# realm-management roles of the lab's role-management client
# (work-items-lab-admin), used only by verify-realm and verify-authorization
# to read the authorization configuration and add or remove role mappings.
# verify-admin-permissions checks that this set suffices and that no role in
# it can be dropped; it reduced the candidate set to these two (query-clients,
